'''Floatglow Lamp''' is a [[Spells|spell]] that produces a floating ball of light. It is used for the [[Floatglow Lamp]] [[contraption]].

== Description ==
There are currently two known seals for Floatglow Lamps. Both contain a [[Sigils#Light|Sigil of Light]].
In [[Chapter 28]], the casting seal contains four [[Signs#Columns|Signs of Columns]] and four [[Signs#Stability and Level Planes|Signs of Level Planes]], evenly arranged to surround the sigil. This seal's effect is never shown, and it can only be attributed to the Floatglow Lamp due to its label in Chapter 28. Based on the signs, this seal would likely create a beam of light floating above the seal as opposed to a ball.{{Ref|m|28|10}}{{Ref|[[Signs Explained#Columns]]}}{{Ref|[[Signs Explained#Stability and Level Planes]]}}

In [[Volume 12]] and [[Episode 2]] of the Anime, the casting seal is instead shown to replace the Signs of Columns with [[Signs#Convergence|Signs of Convergence]] and the Signs of Level Planes with [[Signs#Levitation|Signs of Levitation]]. It should be noted that this seal is specifically named after or shown used with Wall-Anchored Floatglow Lamps in particular. It creates a small, floating ball of light.{{Ref|[[Volume 12]] Extra Page: The Contraptions and Seals of Witch Hat}}{{Ref|a|2}}
